{"id":"bda3b5e2072d9169","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-per-category.md","title":"自然数上的 PER 范畴","display":"df-per-category — 自然数上的 PER 范畴","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-per-category","display":"df-per-category — 自然数上的 PER 范畴","depends_on":["[[16-df-kleene-numbering]]","[[16-df-category]]"],"source":"Definition 1.2.5 and following category construction, pp. 35–36 (PDF 55–56); explicit tagged-arrow encoding","revision_date":"2026-10-20","aliases":["16-df-per-category"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-per-category"},{"key":"display","html":"df-per-category — 自然数上的 PER 范畴"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e3665c73100cecbb\" href=\"?note=e3665c73100cecbb\" title=\"16-df-kleene-numbering\">16-df-kleene-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 1.2.5 and following category construction, pp. 35–36 (PDF 55–56); explicit tagged-arrow encoding"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-per-category</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e3665c73100cecbb\" href=\"?note=e3665c73100cecbb\" title=\"16-df-kleene-numbering\">16-df-kleene-numbering</a> 的同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm K_1\">\\(\\mathrm K_1\\)</span>，简写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\cdot n=e\\cdot_{\\mathrm K_1}n\">\\(e\\cdot n=e\\cdot_{\\mathrm K_1}n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,S\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(R,S\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span> 是对称、传递关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|R|=\\{n\\mid nRn\\}\">\\(|R|=\\{n\\mid nRn\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_R=|R|/R\">\\(Q_R=|R|/R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]_R\">\\([n]_R\\)</span> 表示等价类。 跟踪谓词的输入域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in Q_S^{Q_R}\">\\(f\\in Q_S^{Q_R}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\cdot n\">\\(e\\cdot n\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 上读取。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{\\mathrm{op}}=\\{(n,m)\\mid(m,n)\\in R\\}\">\\(R^{\\mathrm{op}}=\\{(n,m)\\mid(m,n)\\in R\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\circ R=\\{(m,n)\\mid(\\exists k)\\ mRk\\land kRn\\}\">\\(R\\circ R=\\{(m,n)\\mid(\\exists k)\\ mRk\\land kRn\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tracks}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tracks}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>；箭头携带源靶标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(R,S,f)\">\\((R,S,f)\\)</span>，固定 Hom 时简写为被追踪函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:Q_R\\to Q_S\">\\(f:Q_R\\to Q_S\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H(R,S)\">\\(\\mathcal H(R,S)\\)</span> 是下文给出的底层函数集合。下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PER}\">\\(\\mathrm{PER}\\)</span> 是该范畴记录六个分量的固定标签，不是另一个自由数学参数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}per\\text{-}category}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{Tracks}(e,f;R,S)\\Longleftrightarrow\nf:Q_R\\to Q_S\\land\n(\\forall n\\in|R|)\\bigl(e\\cdot n\\downarrow\\land e\\cdot n\\in|S|\n\\land f([n]_R)=[e\\cdot n]_S\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}per\\text{-}category}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{Tracks}(e,f;R,S)\\Longleftrightarrow\nf:Q_R\\to Q_S\\land\n(\\forall n\\in|R|)\\bigl(e\\cdot n\\downarrow\\land e\\cdot n\\in|S|\n\\land f([n]_R)=[e\\cdot n]_S\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_{\\mathrm{PER}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\mid R=R^{\\mathrm{op}}\\land R\\circ R\\subseteq R\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal H(R,S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{f:Q_R\\to Q_S\\mid(\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N)\\mathrm{Tracks}(e,f;R,S)\\},\\\\\nM_{\\mathrm{PER}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(R,S,f)\\mid R,S\\in O_{\\mathrm{PER}}\\land f\\in\\mathcal H(R,S)\\},\\\\\ns_{\\mathrm{PER}}(R,S,f)&amp;\\coloneqq R,\\qquad t_{\\mathrm{PER}}(R,S,f)\\coloneqq S,\\\\\ne_{\\mathrm{PER}}(R)&amp;\\coloneqq(R,R,\\operatorname{id}_{Q_R}),\\\\\nc_{\\mathrm{PER}}((S,T,g),(R,S,f))&amp;\\coloneqq(R,T,g\\circ f),\\\\\n\\mathbf{PER}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_{\\mathrm{PER}},M_{\\mathrm{PER}},s_{\\mathrm{PER}},t_{\\mathrm{PER}},e_{\\mathrm{PER}},c_{\\mathrm{PER}}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{PER})&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_{\\mathrm{PER}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\mid R=R^{\\mathrm{op}}\\land R\\circ R\\subseteq R\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal H(R,S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{f:Q_R\\to Q_S\\mid(\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N)\\mathrm{Tracks}(e,f;R,S)\\},\\\\\nM_{\\mathrm{PER}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(R,S,f)\\mid R,S\\in O_{\\mathrm{PER}}\\land f\\in\\mathcal H(R,S)\\},\\\\\ns_{\\mathrm{PER}}(R,S,f)&amp;\\coloneqq R,\\qquad t_{\\mathrm{PER}}(R,S,f)\\coloneqq S,\\\\\ne_{\\mathrm{PER}}(R)&amp;\\coloneqq(R,R,\\operatorname{id}_{Q_R}),\\\\\nc_{\\mathrm{PER}}((S,T,g),(R,S,f))&amp;\\coloneqq(R,T,g\\circ f),\\\\\n\\mathbf{PER}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_{\\mathrm{PER}},M_{\\mathrm{PER}},s_{\\mathrm{PER}},t_{\\mathrm{PER}},e_{\\mathrm{PER}},c_{\\mathrm{PER}}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{PER})&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>范畴公理由底层函数复合继承；恒等代码、组合代码给出 tracker 闭性。关系运算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{\\mathrm{op}}\">\\(R^{\\mathrm{op}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\circ R\">\\(R\\circ R\\)</span> 在此分别是逆关系与关系复合，不是范畴本身的反向。</li>\n<li>自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 是态射的实现代码，态射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 是商集合间的函数；不可直接把代码写成同构集合的元素。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, Definition 1.2.5 及其后的范畴构造，pp.35–36（PDF55–56）。Definition6.3.1（PDF414）另定义EfF上的一致PER族，不是本页普通PER范畴的直接定义。源靶标签使同一底层函数出现在不同PER之间时仍有单值的范畴源靶。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-kleene-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"e3665c73100cecbb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-kleene-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-kleene-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"e3665c73100cecbb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[16-df-kleene-numbering]] 的同一 $\\mathrm K_1$，简写 $e\\cdot n=e\\cdot_{\\mathrm K_1}n$。$R,S\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2$ 是对称、传递关系。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tracks}$ 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。$\\mathrm{Cat}$ 采用 [[16-df-category]]；箭头携带源靶标签 $(R,S,f)$，固定 Hom 时简写为被追踪函数 $f:Q_R\\to Q_S$。$\\mathcal H(R,S)$ 是下文给出的底层函数集合。下标 $\\mathrm{PER}$ 是该范畴记录六个分量的固定标签，不是另一个自由数学参数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm K_1","display":false},{"tex":"e\\cdot n=e\\cdot_{\\mathrm K_1}n","display":false},{"tex":"R,S\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2","display":false},{"tex":"|R|=\\{n\\mid nRn\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Q_R=|R|/R","display":false},{"tex":"[n]_R","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in Q_S^{Q_R}","display":false},{"tex":"e\\cdot n","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2","display":false},{"tex":"R^{\\mathrm{op}}=\\{(n,m)\\mid(m,n)\\in R\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\circ R=\\{(m,n)\\mid(\\exists k)\\ mRk\\land kRn\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tracks}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"(R,S,f)","display":false},{"tex":"f:Q_R\\to Q_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H(R,S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PER}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}per\\text{-}category}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{Tracks}(e,f;R,S)\\Longleftrightarrow\nf:Q_R\\to Q_S\\land\n(\\forall n\\in|R|)\\bigl(e\\cdot n\\downarrow\\land e\\cdot n\\in|S|\n\\land f([n]_R)=[e\\cdot n]_S\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO_{\\mathrm{PER}}&\\coloneqq\\{R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\mid R=R^{\\mathrm{op}}\\land R\\circ R\\subseteq R\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal H(R,S)&\\coloneqq\\{f:Q_R\\to Q_S\\mid(\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N)\\mathrm{Tracks}(e,f;R,S)\\},\\\\\nM_{\\mathrm{PER}}&\\coloneqq\\{(R,S,f)\\mid R,S\\in O_{\\mathrm{PER}}\\land f\\in\\mathcal H(R,S)\\},\\\\\ns_{\\mathrm{PER}}(R,S,f)&\\coloneqq R,\\qquad t_{\\mathrm{PER}}(R,S,f)\\coloneqq S,\\\\\ne_{\\mathrm{PER}}(R)&\\coloneqq(R,R,\\operatorname{id}_{Q_R}),\\\\\nc_{\\mathrm{PER}}((S,T,g),(R,S,f))&\\coloneqq(R,T,g\\circ f),\\\\\n\\mathbf{PER}&\\coloneqq\\langle O_{\\mathrm{PER}},M_{\\mathrm{PER}},s_{\\mathrm{PER}},t_{\\mathrm{PER}},e_{\\mathrm{PER}},c_{\\mathrm{PER}}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{PER})&.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"R^{\\mathrm{op}}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\circ R","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":2934,"backlinks":[{"id":"07a1592023f10b9f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tracks}(n,f;R,S)$、$Q_R$ 及底层函数集合 $\\mathcal H(R,S)$ 采用 [[16-df-per-category]]。$R,S,T$ 为下节的族对象；$\\mathcal F_A(R,S)$ 为未附源靶标签的共同跟踪函数族集合，$U_A$ 为将它们附上源靶标签后的六元组范畴。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-pca]]、[[16-df-kleene-numbering]]、[[16-df-realizability-fibration]]、[[16-df-set-of-fibration]]、[[16-df-eff-topos]]、[[16-df-effective-global-sections]]、[[16-df-assembly]]、[[16-df-per-category]]、[[16-df-ufam-per]]、[[16-df-context-category]]、[[16-df-syntactic-substitution]]、[[16-df-type-functor]]、[[16-df-term-functor]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]、[[16-thm-reynolds]]。"}],"outgoing":["e3665c73100cecbb","25a281534aa42440"]}